        {
          "type": "application",
          "title": "Your Bone-Keeping Plan",
          "content": "Start sending your skeleton the right signals this week:\n\n1. **Lift something challenging twice a week.** Squats, deadlift patterns, presses, and rows, progressing gradually. If you already have osteoporosis or a spine fracture, ask for a referral to a physical therapist or qualified trainer first.\n\n2. **Add a little impact if it is safe for you** -- a few sets of small hops or heel drops, unless you have osteoporosis of the spine or joint problems; check with your clinician.\n\n3. **Practice balance daily** -- 30 seconds on one leg while brushing your teeth.\n\n4. **Tally your calcium from food for three days** and compare it with your target before adding a supplement.\n\n5. **Fall-proof one room** -- remove a loose rug, add a night light or grab bar.\n\n6. **If you are on a bone medicine,** put a reminder in your calendar to review it with your doctor at the 3-to-5-year mark.\n\nThis is education, not medical advice -- tailor every step with your healthcare team.",
          "visual": {
            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">YOUR BONE PLAN</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Six steps, starting this week</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"170\" width=\"800\" height=\"95\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">1.</text><text x=\"245\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Lift something challenging 2x/week</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"285\" width=\"800\" height=\"95\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"343\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">2.</text><text x=\"245\" y=\"343\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Add safe impact</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"400\" width=\"800\" height=\"95\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"458\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">3.</text><text x=\"245\" y=\"458\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Balance on one leg daily</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"515\" width=\"800\" height=\"95\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"573\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">4.</text><text x=\"245\" y=\"573\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Tally food calcium for 3 days</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"630\" width=\"800\" height=\"95\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"688\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">5.</text><text x=\"245\" y=\"688\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Fall-proof one room</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"745\" width=\"800\" height=\"95\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"803\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">6.</text><text x=\"245\" y=\"803\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Calendar a 3-5 year medication review</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"930\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Tailor every step with your healthcare team</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Load, nutrients, falls, and follow-up -- your bone-keeping routine"
          }
        }
