" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">5.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"705\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Seek a second opinion if dismissed</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"810\" width=\"700\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">Your data makes the pattern visible</text></svg>",
