            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">MYTHS TO RETIRE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Ideas this book challenged</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"160\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Osteoporosis is only for women</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"270\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Heart attacks are a male problem</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"380\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Pregnancy risk ends at delivery</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"490\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Menopause hormones are always dangerous</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"600\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Low energy in a man means low T</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"710\" width=\"800\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">One standard dose fits everyone</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"840\" width=\"700\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"22\">Replace myths with questions</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Beliefs the evidence does not support"
